      "type": "html",
      "html": "<h1 id=\"atak---geofences---avancerade-funktioner\"><a href=\"#atak---geofences---avancerade-funktioner\">ATAK - Geofences - Avancerade funktioner</a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"atak-ansluten-till-takserver---geofences\"><a href=\"#atak-ansluten-till-takserver---geofences\">ATAK ansluten till takserver - Geofences</a></h2>"
    },
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "legacy",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Overvaka med Geofences",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Geofences hjalper dig att overvaka rorelser och handelser i vissa omraden.</li>\n<li>Borja med att rita en omradesform med Drawing Tools.</li>\n<li>Valj sedan Geofence-ikonen och tryck pa den.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/fdd6bca67f66f7ff.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Vilken forandring ska varna oss?",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Tryck pa forandringsvaljaren for att redigera vilken forandring som ska varna oss.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/cf66ed64a0387ce4.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Alternativ for varning",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Valj det som passar dina behov bast.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/f8dff3c7200bab31.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Vilka objekt ska utlosa en varning?",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Vad - nagot som dyker upp i geofence-omradet, ska utlosa en varning? Valj efter behov.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/945a62013c9d842f.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Alternativ: stall in och skicka",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Om du vill skicka din nya Geofence, gor det via den vanliga mottagardialogen.</li>\n<li>Du kan skicka till en Feed. Floder bjuder automatiskt in anvandare som utloser din Geofence.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/ca187847ce9848b9.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Granska situationen",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Fran huvudmenyns Geofences-flik kan du granska alla aktiva stangsel.</li>\n<li>Om Geofences-fliken inte finns i din meny, tryck pa den gula pennan for att hitta och aktivera den.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/d755dc29a4557507.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Lista Geofences",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Du ser listan over stangsel, deras namn och deras status.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/1d4c4647354a2937.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Varning!",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Du far en varning om overtradelse enligt din konfiguration.</li>\n<li>Lista dem under Geofences -> det aktuella stangslet.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/3b610c296faea346.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Granska varningar for ditt stangsel",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Lista varningar i stangselvyn. Tryck pa papperskorgen for att radera eller inaktivera varningen.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/3143b16ad62405e3.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Inaktivera eller radera en varning",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Valj, och det ar allt!</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/sv/attachments/6b6f03778686f4ab.webp",
